@startuml
title Step 1 - Build the default order configuration screen

actor person
participant "EngagementManagement" as EM
participant "PartyInteractionMgt" as PIM
participant "ServiceQualificationMgt" as SQM
participant "ProductConfigurator" as PC
participant "ProductCatalogMgt" as PCM
participant "ProductOrderCapture\n& Validation" as POCV

== Order Capture Initialization from previous interaction ==

note over POCV : Prerequisite: ProductConfigurator component retrieves\npublished catalog information from ProductCatalogMgt

person -> EM : 1 select an offer
activate EM

EM -> PIM : 2 **TMF701 Process Flow** PATCH /processFlow/id3/taskFlow/id2\nSessionId, taskId2 (start order), offering25, addressId9, partyId8,\ncheckServiceQualificationId11
activate PIM

PIM -> PIM : 3 **TMF683 Party Interaction Mgt** PATCH /partyInteraction/id1\n(new interactionItem for Start Order)

PIM -> POCV : 4 **TMF701 Process Flow** POST /processFlow\nsessionId, offeringId25,\ncheckServiceQualificationId11, addressId9, partyId8
activate POCV
note right of POCV : we assume the story is following 2 previous UC

group Check data consistency
    POCV -> PCM : 5 **TMF620 Product Catalog Mgt** GET productOffering/id25
    activate PCM
    PCM --> POCV : 6 **TMF620** 200 OK\nofferingId25 representation
    deactivate PCM
    note right of POCV : Process describes if new SQ requires (via POST)\nor just check previous one (if provided)

    POCV -> SQM : 7 **TMF645 Service Qualification Mgt** GET checkServiceQualification/11\nfields=qualificationResult (or POST checkServiceQualification)
    activate SQM
    SQM --> POCV : 8 **TMF645** 200 OK\ngreen
    deactivate SQM

    POCV -> PC : 9 **TMF760 Product Configuration** POST /queryProductConfiguration\n(offeringId25, partyId8)
    activate PC
    note right of POCV : This is a 'new' acquisition - No need to call Product Inventory
    PC --> POCV : 10 **TMF760** 200 OK\n(ProductConfiguration.id1 proposed with offeringId25,26,89\nactions possible, princing information)\nOR 201 Created (if task persistence is chosen)\n(queryProductConfiguration.id1...)
    deactivate PC
end

POCV --> PIM : 11 **TMF701** 201 Created\nSessionId, ProcessId4, available actions:\nTaskId2 Configure cart[configuration proposed with offeringId25,26,89\nactions possible, princing information, queryProductConfigurationId1, ProductConfiguration.id1],\nTaskId99 quit
deactivate POCV

PIM --> EM : 12 **TMF701** 200 OK\nSessionId, ProcessFlowId4, available actions:\nProcessFlowId4/TaskId2 Configure cart[...],\nProcessFlowId4/TaskId99 quit
deactivate PIM

EM -> EM : 13 display default configuration\n& default values (including prices)
deactivate EM

POCV -> POCV : 14 **TMF622 Product Order Mgt** POST /productOrder\n(draft, offeringId25,26,89 partyId8, productConfiguration characteristics)\nor **TMF663 Shopping Cart Mgt** POST /shoppingCart\n(offeringId25,26,89 partyId8, productConfiguration characteristics)

@enduml
